    "body": "Thank you for the clear report and the code trace.\n\nTriage: `P4` and `enhancement` (set while I triaged: the maintainer asked for it), `effort:high`, `area:ui`, `area:sim`. The level is high because the fix changes stock geometry and the stock simulation, which are under the safety floor.\n\nTwo parts, as you wrote: the cylinder needs an axis (X, Y or any direction), and the rotation field must do what its label says or say what it does. The document can already hold a full rotation in the stock's `Location`, so the project file does not need a new version for the rotation itself. If you want to work on it, comment a line that starts with `claimed:`.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
